title: 'P8-D92: the fuse tracks everything and enforces only law 7'
summary: 'Founder ruling (2026-10-18): tokens/USD are for knowing the spend — never deny the founder''s subscription use. Sessions on local LLMs are tracked by model and project(s). Track everything, enforce nothing: no token/USD/compute caps, no concurrency caps, no quota-error breaker pause, no 30 % human reserve. Only law 7 (never bill an API key / no base-URL override for kernel-spawned sessions) stays enforced. Supersedes the enforcing parts of §3.4 #budget-fuse, the 30 % reserve (OPEN 6 / G-SUB-04) and the user-rung reserve added for Aegis N1; P8-D91''s single bucket stays as the attribution for tracking.'
