    decision: The budget fuse becomes tracking-only (permits always granted, usage recorded per user/repo/session/model/backend, ladder notifications informational); law 7 is the only enforcement
    rationale: 'Founder: tokens are to know the spend; let me spend my subscription as needed; local LLM sessions just tracked by model and project. Chosen over ''safety rails only'' and ''keep 30 % reserve'' when asked.'
